  "NativeMsgGroupArray" : [ {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 14415,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now, afore you set forth to explore the Hidell\r\nCatacombs Depths, I shall speak of the tidings I\r\nhave garnered from the ledger.",
        "Jp" : "では、《ハイデル地下霊廟　深部》調査の前に\r\n手帳から得た情報を話しておこう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286116,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I found it, the [Blocked Passage].\r\nMy father’s old notebook contained\r\ndetails of that incident.",
        "Jp" : "《開かずの路》で見つけた\r\n先代の手帳には、例の事件の詳細が\r\n記されていたのだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286117,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Apparently, it wasn’t Cleric Menville himself who\r\nwas accused by the villagers of heretical\r\nworship, but his wife.\r\nAlthough she denied the charges, she couldn’t\r\nbear the persecution, and she took her own life.",
        "Jp" : "どうも村人に邪教崇拝と糾弾されていたのは\r\n司祭メンヴィル本人ではなく、その妻だったそうだ\r\n否定したが迫害に耐えられず\r\n妻は自ら命を絶ってしまった"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286118,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Immediately afterward, the cleric vanished—\r\nleaving behind words of hexing, he disappeared\r\ninto the depths of the tomb.",
        "Jp" : "その直後に司祭は姿を消した――\r\n呪いの言葉を残し、霊廟の奥へとな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286119,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "My predecessor was deeply entwined in that\r\nmatter; fearing the cleric and his vengeance,\r\nthey sealed the inner sanctum of the mausoleum.",
        "Jp" : "先代はその件に深く関わっていた\r\n司祭を追い、復讐を恐れて\r\n霊廟深部を封鎖したのだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286120,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "He let the woman perish and sealed the cleric\r\nwithin, still breathing.\r\nMaybe out of guilt—this is what was\r\nwritten in the ledger;",
        "Jp" : "女を死なせ、司祭を生きたまま閉じ込めた\r\n後ろめたさからか、手帳にはこうあったよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286121,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "\"Forgive our sins that be bequeathed to\r\nposterity. O valiant one, should that man bring\r\ndisaster upon Tel, I beseech—\"",
        "Jp" : "後世に、私達の罪を遺すことを許してほしい\r\n 勇気ある者よ、もしあの男がテルに\r\n 災いをもたらした時は、どうか――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286122,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It troubles me much, yet 'tis is how it is;\r\nI pray you; with your might,\r\ndeliver Tel from darkness.",
        "Jp" : "――面倒をかけてばかりだが、この通りだ\r\nどうか貴君の力でテルの闇を\r\n突きとめてくれ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286123,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1313,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Alfred",
      "Jp" : "アルフレド"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 14416,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, it appears that the plague was indeed caused\r\nby the cleric's hex.",
        "Jp" : "――そうか、やはり疫病は\r\n司祭の呪いが元になっていたのだな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286124,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis a matter that we, the folk of Tel,\r\nought to have faced ourselves.",
        "Jp" : "本来は、我々テルの住民こそが\r\n向かい合わねばならなかった問題だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286125,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Just realizing that the plague stems from a hex\r\nis a step in the right direction.\r\nOnce we know the cause, we can start looking into\r\nways to deal with it going forward.",
        "Jp" : "疫病が呪いからくるものであると分かった\r\nだけでも収穫だ\r\n原因が分かれば今後は対策について\r\n調べることができるからな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286126,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "And the fact that you drove away the fiend of the\r\nmausoleum, surely it wrought a certain\r\neffect in easing the hex.",
        "Jp" : "貴君が霊廟の魔を払ってくれたことも、\r\nおそらく呪いを薄める一定の効果が\r\nあっただろう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286127,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "On behalf of the village, I proffer our thanks.\r\nWe are truly grateful you gave your all.\r\nTo Tel, you are a hero beyond doubt.",
        "Jp" : "村を代表して礼を言う\r\n力を尽くしてくれたこと、本当に感謝している\r\n貴君はテルにとって、まごうことなき英雄だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286128,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1313,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Alfred",
      "Jp" : "アルフレド"
    }
  }, {
